#| msgid ""
#| "An early prototype: chats and personal notes are available. AI replies are "
#| "not connected yet."
msgid "Your messages are saved. AI replies are not connected yet."
msgstr ""
"Deine Nachrichten werden gespeichert. KI-Antworten sind noch nicht "
